WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Singer, Hein, Host

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
queen

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:03.920
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:20.360
That night the whole room smelled of jasmine.

00:01:25.570 --> 00:01:29.040
The smell even lingered on his sleeve.

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:57.260
It was you.

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:01.840
It's you...

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:04.670
As a last resort there is a left sleeve.

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:16.880
That's why I need you.

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:18.020
Episode 4

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:19.590
This tea.

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:25.730
Glad you like him.

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:31.430
He didn't leave my side to find out

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:32.770
Do I remember?

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:36.070
Your Majesty, why did you turn pale?

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:37.370
And they sweated.

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:42.080
Everything is fine.

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:44.480
I'm tired because I haven't slept all night.

00:02:45.380 --> 00:02:48.580
In this case, tea will be beneficial.

00:02:49.150 --> 00:02:51.620
Have a drink and go to bed.

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:54.350
Try.

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:08.070
You can drink.

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:11.800
I'll pour it myself. You can be free.

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:35.900
Drink. It smells very tasty.

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:51.840
I'll pretend I don't know. This is the only way I can survive.

00:03:57.520 --> 00:03:59.350
Why does he persuade you to drink tea?

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:01.090
Did he poison him?

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:05.660
What's happened?

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:07.660
Taste

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:11.830
very nice.

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:15.600
I'm very happy.

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:18.740
Have you had dinner lately?

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:22.780
The poison will act faster on an empty stomach.

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:24.580
That's why he asks.

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:27.650
You wondered what I was doing.

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:29.620
I was busy.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:31.990
But I was always interested

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:34.150
you and your relatives.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:37.460
Then

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:43.160
drink too.

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:46.570
As a sign of sympathy.

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:52.610
If you insist.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:02.050
Not poisoned.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:16.730
You're an idiot.

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:18.730
She said it herself, as a sign of sympathy.

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:21.900
What are you doing?

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:23.540
Let me go, I need to clear my stomach.

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:29.080
Do you think I poisoned you?

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:31.910
Why? Is there any reason to think so?

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:35.250
Let's wait.

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:38.650
If nothing happens to you,

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:40.920
my innocence will be proven.

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:42.820
What if I don't want to?

00:05:49.730 --> 00:05:52.600
If you are poisoned, your tongue will go numb first.

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:54.570
You'll feel numb

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.800
don't hesitate and strike.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:05:59.810
Do you think I can't?

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:01.970
I'm sure you can.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:04.380
You can do it.

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:07.450
Got it right.

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:11.250
If I die, at least I won’t be alone.

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:21.900
Episode 4: The Man Who Knew Too Much

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:31.700
-Your Majesty.
-I can't do it anymore.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:35.110
Even if my life depends on it.

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:37.840
I will die soon too.

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:45.250
Be careful.

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.520
Will you hurt me in my sleep?

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:51.760
There's something wrong with me.

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:54.290
What did you give me?

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:56.160
Answer the question.

00:06:57.460 --> 00:06:59.170
Where did you go when I

00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:01.300
went to the summer palace?

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:02.770
I want to get lost.

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:04.800
We need to get out.

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:09.310
I can't die when the exit is right in front of me.

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:20.690
What happened to you that night?

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:24.520
It's dangerous. You need to be silent.

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:25.890
I...

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.360
What did you say?

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:29.730
That night

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.000
you tried

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:36.840
kill me.

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:38.870
She knows.

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:41.670
If you knew

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:44.680
why didn't you say anything?

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:46.980
What are you up to?

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:49.480
And I didn’t even know.

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:52.750
I just found out, thanks to your tea.

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:56.690
What a shame.

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:59.630
If I had known earlier, I would definitely have killed you.

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:03.060
Spawn of evil.

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:05.930
Even if you're crazy about someone else,

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:07.270
why kill your wife?

00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:09.200
Do you call yourself a man?

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:11.870
Cho Hwajin is your concubine.

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:14.440
Can't you just indulge in adultery?

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:17.340
Were you going to kill your wife with your own hands?

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.310
She doesn't know the reason.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:24.980
My queen.

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:28.620
That night you heard things you shouldn't have.

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:30.820
What did you hear?

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:34.460
Answer! What did you hear?

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:39.900
So that's not the reason?

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.740
You have a good reason

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:47.110
to kill this woman?

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:49.210
Did I understand correctly?

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:52.380
Don't be fooled.

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:54.310
Was it because I heard something?

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:55.880
or because of love for another woman -

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:57.820
there is only one reason for murder.

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:00.450
I'm just weaker.

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:05.660
If I were stronger, you wouldn't attack me.

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:07.830
I'm easy to kill

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:09.760
because I'm weaker.

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:12.270
This is the real reason.

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:20.470
Let's. Right here.

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:24.980
Prove that you simply kill those who are weaker.

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:42.230
Crap.

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:44.100
I'm beside myself.

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:45.830
Your Majesty.

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:49.500
He didn't take me seriously.

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:54.140
If I were me, I would knock him out with one blow!

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:55.270
Crap!

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:36.850
What's happened?

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:41.550
I always thought that I was a weakling who fought with someone who was stronger.

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:45.020
Therefore, I believed that any techniques

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.690
are acceptable.

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:55.900
The queen knows

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:57.940
that I tried to kill her.

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:09.650
I thought there were many reasons
to kill the queen.

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:12.280
Not just because of the overheard conversation.

00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:15.550
But also because it contributed to tyranny.

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:19.490
Therefore, I thought that I could kill the queen.

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:27.130
However, this was a cowardly excuse.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.400
I'm not ready to fight strong opponents

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:33.110
so he targeted the weak queen.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:37.680
-Your Majesty.
-If I attack the weak,

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.880
How am I different from the rest?

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:46.420
Focus on a righteous goal.

00:11:47.090 --> 00:11:50.790
For a good purpose, all means are good.

00:11:51.490 --> 00:11:54.260
The Kim family cannot be defeated with righteous tactics.

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:01.830
Don't hesitate.

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:04.470
I'm sure their plans are insidious.

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:07.440
Only the queen knows about this now,

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:10.310
I just figured it out.

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:12.380
She needs to be silent.

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:15.050
Sooner or later everything will become clear.

00:12:17.280 --> 00:12:20.120
I will no longer use cowardly tactics.

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:21.220
Your Majesty.

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:24.360
I condemned the queen because she is from the Kim family.

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:27.060
However, she behaved unpredictably.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:31.700
All in all, I'm not who you think I am.

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:33.030
Appearances can be deceiving, you know.

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:36.970
The Queen said she was a different person.

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:40.610
Maybe she was trying to say

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:43.780
that it is cut from a different cloth and acts differently.

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:45.710
What can you expect from her?

00:12:46.150 --> 00:12:47.410
The queen is the same

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:49.650
like the rest of the Kims.

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:52.520
Maybe I'm a puppet king

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:56.390
but the queen's words will give them nothing.

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:58.460
There is no conclusive evidence.

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:02.430
I'll see what the queen does.

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:05.930
At the same time I will find out what kind of person she is.

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:22.580
I found out where this fabric came from,

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:24.980
she is from the palace.

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:29.120
If anyone tried to steal her from the king,

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:31.120
he would definitely have been captured.

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:35.390
That is, a mere mortal cannot do this.

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:40.330
God. I wonder how much they will pay me for my services.

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:43.000
It wasn't easy, sir.

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:47.910
Well done.

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:54.150
From now on, trust me with the heaviest

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:56.220
and dirty work.

00:13:57.180 --> 00:13:58.550
Castle.

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:00.710
Due to one

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:05.720
noble wife we
We won’t win over the king.

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:10.920
He needs something to melt his heart.

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:16.460
The vulnerable spot of the concubine is the incident at the lake.

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:19.700
In that case...

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:22.470
We need to find a scapegoat.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:25.740
Weak and helpless

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:29.510
like a fawn without a mother.

00:15:33.150 --> 00:15:34.510
Someone similar.

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:20.090
Where did the tudjon player go?

00:16:20.090 --> 00:16:21.660
Can't you put the card down?

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:25.060
You wouldn't notice even if I stole your nose.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.070
The thing is...

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:30.470
No. Nothing.

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:32.940
Something is bothering you.

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:39.080
Outside the Palace
There are too many villains roaming around.

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:42.250
I made friends with one guy,

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:43.380
Lee Sanman.

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:45.150
I think

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:48.550
he was also attacked by a villain,

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:50.260
walking around outside the palace.

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:52.290
"Same"? Who else was attacked?

00:16:52.390 --> 00:16:54.630
You know, I'm very perceptive.

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:57.500
My cousin Benin,

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:00.630
seems to be trying

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:05.040
find someone using a piece of fabric.

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:08.570
Chuika tells me

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:12.240
the owner of a piece of clothing, a notorious villain,

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:13.880
wounded

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:16.480
my friend

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:19.420
and ran into my brother.

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:23.320
What do you think?

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:27.730
There's no point in having a talent like you.

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:29.190
did not become a scientist.

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:31.330
A huge loss for the kingdom.

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:36.640
You are as insightful as I am.

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:45.040
Something strange is happening outside the palace.

00:18:00.630 --> 00:18:01.790
Have mercy.

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:04.860
I'll do what you ask. Don't kill.

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:07.100
Mister.

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.230
Madam.

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:12.300
I don't know who you are, but I'm begging you.

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:13.670
Please.

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:18.510
I don't see anything.

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:19.780
Raise your head.

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:23.020
No. I don't want to die.

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:33.860
You still won't see my face.

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:47.110
An influential person is waiting for your answer.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:51.010
I don't know anything.

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:54.210
How should I know anything?

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:56.180
You know

00:18:56.180 --> 00:18:58.980
who tried to harm the queen,
pushing her into the lake.

00:19:00.520 --> 00:19:02.750
You will survive if you name it.

00:19:56.640 --> 00:19:57.810
Sorry, Your Majesty.

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:00.410
It tastes terrible

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:02.110
but very useful.

00:20:09.050 --> 00:20:12.060
Yesterday the queen's father brought something.

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:13.660
I drink on an empty stomach

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:16.090
and I feel rejuvenated.

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:20.530
He always knows where to get something unusual.

00:20:21.270 --> 00:20:23.570
As an advisor to the royal kitchen

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:25.370
he brings the most

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:26.610
suitable things.

00:20:39.990 --> 00:20:41.020
By the way,

00:20:41.020 --> 00:20:43.860
what about our affairs in the palace?

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:46.730
There is a person in mind

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:48.230
I'm making preparations.

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:52.330
It's clear. As soon as it's over,

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:55.700
It will be one less thing for me to worry about.

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:57.440
Yes.

00:20:58.240 --> 00:21:01.010
This time there will be no room for mistakes.

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:18.320
Kim Byunin

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:21.130
trying to find a person

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:22.560
a piece of the king's clothing.

00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:30.940
I destroyed the clothes.

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:34.540
But since the queen found out the truth...

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:37.480
If Byonin finds out everything and comes for me,

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:40.250
It means I made a mistake about the queen.

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:42.450
-Such games are too dangerous.
-I know.

00:21:43.520 --> 00:21:46.080
But if I'm right

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:49.120
then an innocent person will not suffer.

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:56.930
Today is my father-in-law's first day on the job.

00:22:07.040 --> 00:22:08.040
Your Majesty.

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:11.610
I thought you were still in Daejojeon Hall.

00:22:11.880 --> 00:22:13.580
Came here to check.

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:17.780
I need to share
important knowledge with Prince Yeonpyeong.

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:24.160
Are you that shocked?

00:22:29.690 --> 00:22:31.000
Chief Eunuch.

00:22:33.170 --> 00:22:34.200
Yes.

00:22:44.180 --> 00:22:46.080
What a psychopath.

00:22:46.240 --> 00:22:48.810
I thought he was just a fool, and this was all a performance.

00:22:49.510 --> 00:22:51.820
The king tried to kill
the queen with your own hands?

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:54.890
If I start such a huge scandal,

00:22:54.890 --> 00:22:56.660
I’ll find myself at the epicenter, this is even more dangerous.

00:22:57.160 --> 00:22:59.020
I'll wait until the lake is filled.

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:01.690
Until then I won't stick my head out
and return to my life.

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:04.860
Your hands are probably numb.

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:06.470
Keep crossed for so long.

00:23:07.600 --> 00:23:09.370
This calms me down.

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:16.210
My thoughts don’t calm down, even though I want to stop.

00:23:17.210 --> 00:23:18.940
What did he put in my tea?

00:23:18.940 --> 00:23:21.480
I knew it. Not for a second
you can't relax.

00:23:22.910 --> 00:23:25.820
But if he wanted to finish me off, he could have simply poisoned me.

00:23:26.550 --> 00:23:27.620
So why...

00:23:27.620 --> 00:23:28.990
Fuck it.

00:23:28.990 --> 00:23:30.890
Why should I worry about this patient?

00:23:32.760 --> 00:23:34.590
Let's check how things are going with the lake.

00:23:35.130 --> 00:23:36.960
Do you have any whip?

00:23:36.960 --> 00:23:38.460
We need to hurry them up.

00:23:38.460 --> 00:23:39.630
Your Majesty.

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:49.040
The Queen Dowager invites you to her place.

00:23:50.370 --> 00:23:53.040
I don't need her now.

00:23:53.040 --> 00:23:54.050
Crap.

00:24:20.410 --> 00:24:22.770
It's annoying. What more does she want from me?

00:24:22.770 --> 00:24:23.910
Crap.

00:24:56.170 --> 00:24:59.280
Continue. Everything will work out! Hang in there.

00:25:00.280 --> 00:25:02.150
What are you doing? Faster.

00:25:02.150 --> 00:25:04.420
-Here.
- Move.

00:25:04.720 --> 00:25:06.120
More alive, more alive.

00:25:06.120 --> 00:25:08.320
More alive. We need to hurry.

00:25:08.320 --> 00:25:10.060
It's urgent. Let's hurry up.

00:25:10.060 --> 00:25:12.260
Continue.

00:25:15.130 --> 00:25:16.700
Be careful. Move over.

00:25:18.900 --> 00:25:21.070
I can't stand it anymore.

00:25:21.070 --> 00:25:22.870
I'm going to the restroom. I'll be back soon.

00:25:23.130 --> 00:25:24.900
So much work. Come back quickly.

00:25:25.770 --> 00:25:26.910
More alive.

00:25:32.610 --> 00:25:36.250
I heard that you were coming, so I was waiting for you.

00:25:37.350 --> 00:25:39.150
But what's the matter?

00:25:39.520 --> 00:25:43.960
The Queen Mother is very interested in you.

00:25:44.060 --> 00:25:45.660
It's an honor for me.

00:25:46.120 --> 00:25:48.260
I heard your little brother is in slavery

00:25:48.260 --> 00:25:49.960
because of family debt.

00:25:49.960 --> 00:25:52.760
Yes. In the whole world I only have a brother left.

00:25:53.230 --> 00:25:55.230
I heard you're very worried

00:25:55.900 --> 00:25:58.070
and you will do anything to restore

00:25:58.070 --> 00:25:59.370
his brother's position.

00:25:59.370 --> 00:26:02.740
I save money as much as I can.

00:26:03.410 --> 00:26:05.510
But the debt is very large.

00:26:06.240 --> 00:26:08.680
Because the Queen Mother appreciates you,

00:26:08.680 --> 00:26:10.120
she proposes to you.

00:26:11.150 --> 00:26:13.890
You won't have this chance again.

00:26:18.420 --> 00:26:19.720
How long will it take?

00:26:20.990 --> 00:26:22.490
A little.

00:26:25.460 --> 00:26:27.270
Make her admit it too.

00:26:28.430 --> 00:26:30.000
The person who sent the letter

00:26:31.440 --> 00:26:32.570
Queen Mother.

00:26:34.740 --> 00:26:35.770
I understand.

00:26:37.610 --> 00:26:39.210
If I take the blame for this,

00:26:39.210 --> 00:26:41.910
My brother and I won't survive.

00:26:41.910 --> 00:26:44.180
No need to worry about your brother.

00:26:44.450 --> 00:26:45.620
Your dedication

00:26:45.620 --> 00:26:48.390
gives him new life.

00:26:48.620 --> 00:26:49.690
But...

00:26:50.690 --> 00:26:53.060
How long do you think

00:26:53.790 --> 00:26:56.800
can he endure such a hard life?

00:26:57.330 --> 00:27:00.930
What if something bad happens tomorrow, like an accident?

00:27:03.670 --> 00:27:05.740
Anything bad?

00:27:14.080 --> 00:27:16.780
Did you call me, Your Majesty?

00:27:17.580 --> 00:27:19.280
I invited you

00:27:19.450 --> 00:27:22.650
because I want to entrust you with something important.

00:27:22.850 --> 00:27:25.090
Damn, what else? What a hassle.

00:27:25.520 --> 00:27:27.990
It's too early for me to take responsibility
in important matters,

00:27:27.990 --> 00:27:30.460
because there is still a lot to learn.

00:27:31.430 --> 00:27:33.330
Yes?

00:27:33.930 --> 00:27:35.330
What a shame.

00:27:35.630 --> 00:27:38.340
I wanted to choose the most graceful concubines for the king,

00:27:38.340 --> 00:27:41.570
who can amaze and charm the king.

00:27:41.840 --> 00:27:43.740
I guess there's no choice
except to figure it out yourself.

00:27:44.780 --> 00:27:45.810
Mencius said,

00:27:46.080 --> 00:27:48.380
that virtuous people are supported.

00:27:48.380 --> 00:27:49.810
Develop virtue and you will receive help.

00:27:50.220 --> 00:27:51.680
I may have a lot to learn

00:27:51.680 --> 00:27:54.190
many are ready to help me
thanks to my virtue.

00:27:55.120 --> 00:27:57.360
So I will try my best.

00:27:57.960 --> 00:27:59.060
By the way,

00:27:59.420 --> 00:28:02.260
What is the maximum number of concubines?

00:28:03.330 --> 00:28:04.400
Maximum?

00:28:04.660 --> 00:28:07.130
Well I mean how much

00:28:07.330 --> 00:28:10.070
can we choose?

00:28:10.740 --> 00:28:13.340
Don't even know. According to the classics,

00:28:13.470 --> 00:28:16.840
there should be 6 concubines of the first rank, 3 of the second,

00:28:16.840 --> 00:28:19.440
9 third, 27 fourth,

00:28:19.440 --> 00:28:21.650
and 81 fifth,

00:28:21.650 --> 00:28:24.280
-who will serve the king.
-Come on.

00:28:24.720 --> 00:28:27.420
6 plus 3.

00:28:27.920 --> 00:28:29.020
9.

00:28:29.550 --> 00:28:30.760
27.

00:28:31.260 --> 00:28:32.620
And 81?

00:28:33.530 --> 00:28:36.160
But we need to be restrained, we will choose only 3.

00:28:36.330 --> 00:28:37.630
Damn it.

00:28:39.730 --> 00:28:40.970
Great!

00:28:41.500 --> 00:28:43.570
Undoubtedly.

00:28:44.400 --> 00:28:45.970
His Majesty already has a concubine,

00:28:45.970 --> 00:28:48.040
I need to choose 2 more, right?

00:28:48.040 --> 00:28:50.540
No, we'll choose 3.

00:28:51.680 --> 00:28:54.910
The concubine brought with her
court lady Ovol.

00:28:55.110 --> 00:28:57.280
Yeah, that girl who runs after her.

00:28:57.650 --> 00:28:59.320
She said something crazy

00:28:59.650 --> 00:29:01.790
out of devotion to the concubine.

00:29:02.490 --> 00:29:04.860
Why did you jump into the lake?

00:29:04.860 --> 00:29:07.290
right in front of Cho Hwajin to defame her.

00:29:07.290 --> 00:29:08.660
I spread such rumors.

00:29:09.630 --> 00:29:13.630
The king lied to protect Hwajin and she ruined everything.

00:29:14.570 --> 00:29:15.570
King?

00:29:15.570 --> 00:29:18.540
I'm going to deprive the king
his favorite toy

00:29:18.540 --> 00:29:21.010
so I want to give him new ones.

00:29:23.310 --> 00:29:27.780
Yes. I also want you to prepare lunch for me.

00:29:27.780 --> 00:29:31.050
I can't eat anymore
that was prepared by someone else.

00:29:31.980 --> 00:29:34.150
Damn, this is somehow not very good.

00:29:38.420 --> 00:29:40.660
What if you eat every day
healthy food I prepared

00:29:41.290 --> 00:29:43.400
and start looking younger than me?

00:29:43.760 --> 00:29:45.830
I wouldn't like that.

00:29:54.440 --> 00:29:57.580
You need to maintain good relations with her until the lake is filled.

00:30:02.740 --> 00:30:05.340
Everything happened exactly as Kim So-yeon wanted.

00:30:06.080 --> 00:30:08.110
She led Hwajin into a real trap.

00:30:09.550 --> 00:30:11.880
Hey girl. This will come back to haunt you.

00:30:13.180 --> 00:30:14.920
I feel sorry for Hwajin.

00:30:15.890 --> 00:30:18.060
But what's the difference?
I won't care when I get back.

00:30:18.060 --> 00:30:19.560
There is no time to worry about others yet.

00:30:19.560 --> 00:30:21.460
I would like to deal with myself first.

00:30:23.290 --> 00:30:24.530
More alive.

00:30:24.930 --> 00:30:28.400
You two can take your time.

00:30:28.530 --> 00:30:30.200
If you fall again, you will be injured.

00:30:33.810 --> 00:30:35.040
More alive, more alive!

00:30:37.210 --> 00:30:39.780
More alive, more alive!

00:30:40.010 --> 00:30:42.910
More alive, more alive! Yes, yes! Even more alive!

00:31:00.970 --> 00:31:03.230
Just like that!

00:31:13.480 --> 00:31:15.110
Damn, this is cool.

00:31:15.480 --> 00:31:17.850
Only high society has such goodies.

00:31:18.750 --> 00:31:21.250
Royal guard.

00:31:23.960 --> 00:31:25.560
Great!

00:31:32.100 --> 00:31:33.570
Hello Mr. Kim.

00:31:33.570 --> 00:31:35.970
Last day, right?

00:31:36.230 --> 00:31:38.100
It's sad, I guess.

00:31:38.100 --> 00:31:41.570
No, I'm sure you'll do much better.

00:31:41.740 --> 00:31:42.870
Oh you.

00:31:46.610 --> 00:31:48.450
What an amazing horse.

00:31:51.450 --> 00:31:54.490
This is His Majesty's gift to the Commander of the Royal Guard.

00:31:55.020 --> 00:31:56.290
Sit down.

00:31:56.420 --> 00:32:00.230
Come on. How many years have passed?
the last time I rode a horse.

00:32:00.560 --> 00:32:04.300
And the position is not officially mine,
until I receive my certificate today.

00:32:05.060 --> 00:32:07.270
-Well, next time.
-Yes.

00:32:08.230 --> 00:32:12.100
Oh Mister Kim. Can you ride a horse?

00:32:13.670 --> 00:32:14.740
Who are you?

00:32:17.410 --> 00:32:19.480
I am His Majesty's best friend.

00:32:19.480 --> 00:32:22.280
And the maids consider me
one of the 5 most charming...

00:32:22.280 --> 00:32:25.250
You don't need to know who he is.

00:32:25.580 --> 00:32:27.650
Prince Yeonpyeong was not even included in the ranking.

00:32:27.920 --> 00:32:30.290
But your physique

00:32:30.290 --> 00:32:32.790
not very suitable for riding.

00:32:32.860 --> 00:32:34.860
And what a tall horse.

00:32:34.860 --> 00:32:36.830
At least jump on it
with your short legs?

00:32:41.370 --> 00:32:42.430
What are you talking about?

00:32:42.670 --> 00:32:44.000
Yes in the old days

00:32:44.700 --> 00:32:46.440
I jumped without hands.

00:32:46.440 --> 00:32:48.370
That's how good he was.

00:32:48.370 --> 00:32:50.010
He sat on horseback as if in a chair.

00:32:50.010 --> 00:32:53.210
Once I fell asleep on a horse,
I even saw dreams.

00:32:55.280 --> 00:32:56.580
Yes, I'm serious.

00:32:56.920 --> 00:32:59.020
I'll prove it to you. Here you go.

00:33:02.520 --> 00:33:05.360
You don't have to do this.
Don't force yourself.

00:33:05.360 --> 00:33:07.330
Oh shut up!

00:33:07.860 --> 00:33:09.830
I still can.

00:33:14.370 --> 00:33:15.600
Doesn't seem to be the case.

00:33:17.270 --> 00:33:20.170
Hey, can you...

00:33:20.410 --> 00:33:22.310
That's it.

00:33:27.150 --> 00:33:29.750
What did you see? It couldn't be simpler.

00:33:42.860 --> 00:33:45.230
Oh, mommies.

00:33:47.100 --> 00:33:48.230
Got it.

00:34:00.180 --> 00:34:03.180
Oh, you little cat.

00:34:04.050 --> 00:34:05.480
Oh, mommies.

00:34:05.480 --> 00:34:08.120
- Mister Kim!
-My legs! Legs!

00:34:08.120 --> 00:34:10.420
Legs!

00:34:10.520 --> 00:34:13.260
Potatoes, salt and milk.

00:34:14.290 --> 00:34:15.360
Milk?

00:34:16.130 --> 00:34:17.860
Never heard of this before.

00:34:19.860 --> 00:34:21.470
Also called milk.

00:34:21.670 --> 00:34:22.870
Understood.

00:34:22.870 --> 00:34:25.440
Such a rare ingredient
but it drowns like water.

00:34:25.440 --> 00:34:26.940
You won't have any oil.

00:34:28.410 --> 00:34:29.470
Do you have black pepper?

00:34:29.640 --> 00:34:30.910
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:34:31.380 --> 00:34:35.050
More valuable than gold, but sinks like sand.

00:34:35.050 --> 00:34:38.020
But she won't listen to me,
So I won’t say anything.

00:34:39.880 --> 00:34:41.020
I hear you, okay?

00:34:43.660 --> 00:34:46.220
-Your Majesty!
-Oh you.

00:34:46.220 --> 00:34:49.130
I told you not to rush. Why did you run?

00:34:51.860 --> 00:34:54.330
Court lady Choi also hurried here.

00:34:54.730 --> 00:34:57.170
She's not young. What if you faint
Did you fall while you were running?

00:34:57.170 --> 00:34:59.170
I'm there!

00:35:01.070 --> 00:35:03.040
Maybe I'm a little slow

00:35:03.040 --> 00:35:05.140
but I will never faint.

00:35:12.850 --> 00:35:14.050
What a stubborn lady.

00:35:18.620 --> 00:35:21.430
-Okay, pour it.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

00:35:32.840 --> 00:35:33.870
That's all?

00:35:35.040 --> 00:35:37.910
-Are you kidding me?
-Well, the thing is...

00:35:37.940 --> 00:35:41.710
Your Majesty, this is a very rare thing.

00:35:41.980 --> 00:35:43.820
That's why I need it.

00:35:44.120 --> 00:35:45.820
When cooking, it's all about the ingredients.

00:35:46.150 --> 00:35:49.420
If everything is milked, the calves will starve.

00:35:49.890 --> 00:35:51.390
And caring too.

00:35:51.460 --> 00:35:53.290
Damn, sadness.

00:35:54.560 --> 00:35:56.130
Have you heard about fasting days?

00:35:56.130 --> 00:35:58.260
Intermittent fasting is good for your health.

00:35:59.730 --> 00:36:01.830
Fill my cauldron this far.

00:36:02.400 --> 00:36:05.140
Be at least a drop less... You know, right?

00:36:08.910 --> 00:36:10.240
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:36:16.080 --> 00:36:17.180
Hmm, yeah.

00:36:19.680 --> 00:36:20.820
Who are you?

00:36:21.220 --> 00:36:22.820
How dare the girl show up...

00:36:32.760 --> 00:36:33.800
Come here.

00:36:38.600 --> 00:36:39.700
What's your name?

00:36:39.700 --> 00:36:41.310
Damhyang.

00:36:42.310 --> 00:36:43.940
You are raising a puppy in the palace.

00:36:44.610 --> 00:36:47.610
The dog has a higher status than me.

00:36:48.010 --> 00:36:50.650
The dog was brought by envoys from Ming.

00:36:50.650 --> 00:36:53.250
They said it was a rare breed or something like that.

00:36:54.790 --> 00:36:57.120
Min? This was 200 years ago.

00:36:58.320 --> 00:37:00.730
If during these centuries the breed mixed with others,

00:37:00.730 --> 00:37:03.130
then it's just a mongrel.

00:37:04.360 --> 00:37:05.660
And what's his name?

00:37:05.960 --> 00:37:07.900
The dog doesn't have a name yet.

00:37:07.900 --> 00:37:09.570
Is it true? Then

00:37:10.700 --> 00:37:13.240
-Let's call him Bes.
-A demon?

00:37:13.500 --> 00:37:14.510
Look.

00:37:15.170 --> 00:37:16.940
So, let's write.

00:37:18.910 --> 00:37:23.610
P - E - S. Let's replace p with a paired consonant.

00:37:23.810 --> 00:37:25.420
PES

00:37:25.440 --> 00:37:26.520
B

00:37:27.690 --> 00:37:28.750
E

00:37:29.650 --> 00:37:31.920
And we got a demon.

00:37:32.360 --> 00:37:33.690
Therefore, Bes.

00:37:33.690 --> 00:37:36.060
Now I understand.

00:37:40.330 --> 00:37:42.530
You come here often, probably hungry.

00:37:44.600 --> 00:37:45.670
Just a second.

00:37:48.510 --> 00:37:49.540
So.

00:37:53.040 --> 00:37:54.310
Voila.

00:37:57.920 --> 00:37:58.980
Try.

00:38:02.020 --> 00:38:03.090
Here.

00:38:09.030 --> 00:38:10.190
Why don't you eat?

00:38:10.190 --> 00:38:12.900
Because it's too beautiful.

00:38:14.430 --> 00:38:16.170
Don't worry. This is not for free.

00:38:16.170 --> 00:38:18.500
As soon as you eat, you can help me with the potatoes.

00:38:18.500 --> 00:38:19.540
This is not possible.

00:38:20.670 --> 00:38:23.240
I am ready to put up with your presence, because you are a queen.

00:38:23.240 --> 00:38:24.780
For a long time, women did not dare

00:38:24.780 --> 00:38:26.810
touch the royal food.

00:38:26.810 --> 00:38:28.410
They are allowed to decorate dishes

00:38:28.410 --> 00:38:29.810
and serve them on the table.

00:38:29.810 --> 00:38:32.150
Rootless and without official position...

00:38:33.380 --> 00:38:34.520
This baby

00:38:34.520 --> 00:38:38.190
cannot help prepare food.

00:38:40.790 --> 00:38:43.360
What an old fart.

00:38:44.660 --> 00:38:47.200
And try it. "Old fart".

00:38:47.200 --> 00:38:49.030
-Old fart.
-What?

00:38:49.030 --> 00:38:51.840
Wow, you said it so clearly.

00:38:52.900 --> 00:38:54.570
Now call him old fart.

00:38:55.370 --> 00:38:56.570
Don't get distracted. Eat.

00:39:01.180 --> 00:39:03.710
It feels like I'm eating a cloud.

00:39:05.250 --> 00:39:07.290
Great comparison.

00:39:07.650 --> 00:39:09.790
You could host the show.

00:39:10.660 --> 00:39:11.690
Pf.

00:39:13.160 --> 00:39:15.630
By the way, isn't she too young for the palace?

00:39:16.690 --> 00:39:18.860
Her parents didn't pay taxes

00:39:18.860 --> 00:39:20.100
that's why they took her away.

00:39:20.100 --> 00:39:22.030
Everyone in her family became slaves,

00:39:22.630 --> 00:39:25.640
and her so-called father ran away cowardly.

00:39:25.640 --> 00:39:28.040
That's it. What kind of father is this?

00:39:29.410 --> 00:39:30.510
Royal chef.

00:39:31.380 --> 00:39:32.780
Do you have no conscience at all?

00:39:35.510 --> 00:39:36.650
Damhyang.

00:39:36.650 --> 00:39:39.620
Ignore all the bad things, okay?

00:39:42.420 --> 00:39:43.620
Fool.

00:39:44.320 --> 00:39:45.360
Repeat.

00:39:45.990 --> 00:39:47.120
Fool.

00:39:47.990 --> 00:39:50.330
What? Fool?

00:39:50.490 --> 00:39:51.660
Fool!

00:40:04.680 --> 00:40:07.240
Why are potato balls so big?

00:40:07.880 --> 00:40:09.780
When will the milk be brought?

00:40:10.610 --> 00:40:11.750
Your Majesty.

00:40:14.220 --> 00:40:19.320
I milked all the cows to the very last drop.

00:40:24.400 --> 00:40:26.260
Well done.

00:40:27.500 --> 00:40:28.730
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:40:36.210 --> 00:40:37.740
Milk porridge.

00:40:46.050 --> 00:40:48.490
Why do you add potatoes to your porridge?

00:40:48.490 --> 00:40:49.620
How so.

00:40:49.790 --> 00:40:52.060
What are you, my mother-in-law?

00:40:52.060 --> 00:40:53.920
Mothers-in-law should not interfere with their daughters-in-law.

00:40:54.960 --> 00:40:55.960
What?

00:40:56.190 --> 00:40:58.760
Why shouldn't mothers-in-law interfere with their daughters-in-law?

00:40:58.760 --> 00:41:00.260
This is wrong.

00:41:07.170 --> 00:41:08.170
Fine.

00:41:20.720 --> 00:41:22.720
I'll bring it to her personally.

00:41:54.790 --> 00:41:56.020
Simply delicious.

00:41:59.420 --> 00:42:00.520
However,

00:42:01.560 --> 00:42:04.260
As the potatoes cool, they become hard.

00:42:04.830 --> 00:42:07.670
And the milk porridge splashed all over the plate.

00:42:07.670 --> 00:42:09.200
This is all, of course, unpleasant.

00:42:09.600 --> 00:42:10.670
But I understand

00:42:11.440 --> 00:42:13.470
no one is perfect.

00:42:18.280 --> 00:42:19.940
It's impossible to cook the perfect dish

00:42:19.940 --> 00:42:21.710
without proper maintenance.

00:42:22.780 --> 00:42:24.950
How can I serve a dish without it getting cold?

00:42:24.950 --> 00:42:26.780
and it didn't spill?

00:42:26.780 --> 00:42:28.320
That's the main question.

00:43:20.970 --> 00:43:22.510
Let's ask the experts.

00:43:26.510 --> 00:43:27.510
Take it.

00:43:27.510 --> 00:43:29.050
Why haven't you glued this yet?

00:43:29.050 --> 00:43:30.710
Are you still not finished?

00:43:30.710 --> 00:43:32.950
-What do you do?
- Hurry up.

00:43:36.190 --> 00:43:40.190
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

00:43:40.190 --> 00:43:41.230
Your Majesty.

00:43:45.860 --> 00:43:48.700
Palanquin. I need a palanquin for food.

00:43:48.700 --> 00:43:49.700
Your Majesty.

00:43:50.070 --> 00:43:52.140
Your Majesty.

00:43:52.470 --> 00:43:53.570
Palanquin for food?

00:43:53.570 --> 00:43:55.310
-Palanquin for food?
-Palanquin for food?

00:43:55.310 --> 00:43:57.540
-What kind of palanquin for food?
-Palanquin for food?

00:43:58.840 --> 00:44:00.780
Palanquin for food?

00:44:00.780 --> 00:44:02.680
-What?
-Palanquin for food?

00:44:02.950 --> 00:44:04.380
-What are you whispering there?
-Palanquin for food?

00:44:05.650 --> 00:44:06.850
-What?
-Palanquin for food?

00:44:07.720 --> 00:44:09.320
Be careful.

00:44:10.720 --> 00:44:11.760
We pass it on.

00:44:12.960 --> 00:44:13.990
Like this.

00:44:15.090 --> 00:44:16.590
Her Majesty is here.

00:44:18.160 --> 00:44:20.860
-Gathered. One-two.
-One or two.

00:44:20.860 --> 00:44:24.500
-One-two, one-two.
-One-two, one-two.

00:44:24.500 --> 00:44:26.300
-One-two, one-two.
-Well, let's see.

00:44:26.300 --> 00:44:29.310
-One-two, one-two.
-One-two, one-two.

00:44:29.310 --> 00:44:31.040
-What? Is that all?
-One or two.

00:44:31.040 --> 00:44:32.980
-One-two, one-two.
-One-two, one-two.

00:44:32.980 --> 00:44:34.140
-One or two.
-One or two.

00:44:34.140 --> 00:44:35.880
-Did you really work all night?
-Yes.

00:44:35.880 --> 00:44:37.250
We worked in shifts.

00:44:37.250 --> 00:44:39.680
They collected water and poured it into the lake all night.

00:44:39.680 --> 00:44:41.290
But the lake is very big.

00:44:41.290 --> 00:44:42.320
-One or two.
-One or two.

00:44:42.320 --> 00:44:44.190
A day was enough to drain the lake.

00:44:44.190 --> 00:44:45.590
Why does it take so long to fill?

00:44:45.590 --> 00:44:47.590
The lake is located on a hill, so

00:44:47.590 --> 00:44:50.230
It is easy to drain - just make a well.

00:44:51.400 --> 00:44:54.100
I bet they relaxed

00:44:54.100 --> 00:44:55.970
because there is no caretaker.

00:44:57.570 --> 00:44:58.740
-One or two.
-One or two.

00:45:05.580 --> 00:45:08.180
Maybe after we're done,

00:45:08.580 --> 00:45:11.380
Shall we have a glass?

00:45:13.750 --> 00:45:15.720
What do you think? A?

00:45:16.820 --> 00:45:19.360
I asked you a question! These are the brats.

00:45:22.860 --> 00:45:24.960
What brought you here?

00:45:25.160 --> 00:45:28.930
Her Majesty wants some refreshments.

00:45:29.670 --> 00:45:30.830
Queen?

00:45:34.440 --> 00:45:35.470
How's that?

00:45:36.970 --> 00:45:40.680
Then I'll make a simple azalea punch.

00:45:41.350 --> 00:45:42.710
For the first harvest

00:45:42.710 --> 00:45:45.780
The lemongrass berries are well ripe.

00:45:46.150 --> 00:45:48.920
Brew tea from berries and sweeten with honey.

00:45:48.920 --> 00:45:51.920
I'll add pears and tangerines for freshness.

00:45:52.360 --> 00:45:54.430
To maintain this freshness and

00:45:54.430 --> 00:45:56.430
Cool the drink and add ice.

00:45:57.090 --> 00:45:59.900
Since the azaleas have not yet bloomed,

00:46:00.100 --> 00:46:03.000
I use evening primrose. We remove the pestle,

00:46:03.000 --> 00:46:04.840
a little starch

00:46:04.840 --> 00:46:06.900
drop into boiling water

00:46:06.900 --> 00:46:08.610
and cool in cold water.

00:46:08.770 --> 00:46:11.210
We use flowers to decorate the punch.

00:46:11.710 --> 00:46:15.180
The finishing touch is three pine nuts.

00:46:21.250 --> 00:46:24.360
I can make this drink with my eyes closed.

00:46:24.520 --> 00:46:25.620
Like this.

00:46:28.530 --> 00:46:32.430
Well, I saw how you did it with your eyes wide open.

00:46:39.340 --> 00:46:41.770
Why is she only looking at me?

00:46:43.070 --> 00:46:44.210
How embarrassing.

00:46:59.360 --> 00:47:01.160
Let's maintain the rhythm.

00:47:05.760 --> 00:47:08.870
Your Majesty, here is your drink.

00:47:09.270 --> 00:47:13.140
What? Yes. Let's see.

00:47:13.840 --> 00:47:15.970
I'm certainly not in that position

00:47:16.270 --> 00:47:17.980
but if you can't avoid it, enjoy it.

00:47:21.550 --> 00:47:22.610
That's good.

00:47:30.820 --> 00:47:32.060
How much longer?

00:47:32.190 --> 00:47:34.390
At this rate we'll be done by nightfall.

00:47:34.390 --> 00:47:35.490
Until sunset.

00:47:35.990 --> 00:47:38.100
This is impossible.

00:47:38.100 --> 00:47:40.400
How dare you. Make sure you finish today.

00:47:40.400 --> 00:47:42.530
Otherwise heads will roll.

00:47:43.600 --> 00:47:44.640
I obey.

00:47:47.940 --> 00:47:50.470
-One-two, one-two.
-One-two, one-two.

00:47:50.470 --> 00:47:52.010
-One-two, one-two.
-One-two, one-two.

00:47:52.010 --> 00:47:53.140
Tell the royal chef

00:47:53.310 --> 00:47:56.310
-prepare this drink for everyone who is here.
-One-two, one-two.

00:47:56.310 --> 00:47:58.220
-One-two, one-two.
-One-two, one-two.

00:47:58.220 --> 00:47:59.780
-For all these servants?
-One-two, one-two.

00:47:59.780 --> 00:48:01.990
-One-two, one-two.
-One-two, one-two.

00:48:01.990 --> 00:48:05.020
-One-two, one-two.
-One-two, one-two.

00:48:11.830 --> 00:48:15.300
She came here again, must have fallen in love with my talent.

00:48:16.330 --> 00:48:19.840
I'm sure she'll ask for more punch.

00:48:21.670 --> 00:48:23.010
Yes, I'm listening.

00:48:23.010 --> 00:48:25.610
The Queen asks you to prepare more punch.

00:48:26.980 --> 00:48:29.150
I knew she would want more.

00:48:29.550 --> 00:48:33.650
Did she happen to drop the cup because of the great taste?

00:48:34.320 --> 00:48:37.190
Or maybe she shed a tear?

00:48:40.360 --> 00:48:43.160
Court Lady Choi, you see,

00:48:44.160 --> 00:48:45.330
what kind of person I am.

00:48:47.400 --> 00:48:49.400
-Royal cook.
-Royal cook.

00:48:49.400 --> 00:48:51.030
Well, well, stop there.

00:48:52.340 --> 00:48:54.170
Royal Chef, the thing is...

00:48:54.170 --> 00:48:58.380
Of course I will do a little for you too.

00:48:59.310 --> 00:49:02.880
I think you liked the drink too

00:49:03.280 --> 00:49:05.320
more than usual.

00:49:11.290 --> 00:49:12.590
Did you see what I did?

00:49:12.590 --> 00:49:14.590
It was funny.

00:49:24.300 --> 00:49:26.900
I'll make another one. Wait a moment.

00:49:27.140 --> 00:49:31.280
While you're cooking one, would you like to make a little more?

00:49:32.180 --> 00:49:35.750
Certainly. How much do you need?

00:49:37.010 --> 00:49:39.380
-Here you go.
-How delicious.

00:49:39.380 --> 00:49:41.080
Thank you.

00:49:41.290 --> 00:49:43.720
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:49:53.530 --> 00:49:56.430
It's so expensive. Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:49:56.870 --> 00:49:58.200
At least you're aware.

00:49:59.100 --> 00:50:02.010
Thank you for your generosity, Your Majesty.

00:50:02.010 --> 00:50:05.440
Thank you for your generosity, Your Majesty.

00:50:05.610 --> 00:50:07.780
Yes, yes. Nothing special.

00:50:08.280 --> 00:50:09.610
Don't stand there, drink.

00:50:12.720 --> 00:50:14.450
It's so delicious.

00:50:15.450 --> 00:50:17.520
They are so easy to make work.

00:50:24.360 --> 00:50:28.230
I hide so well that even a bird won't notice.

00:50:31.370 --> 00:50:33.440
I put in so much effort

00:50:33.940 --> 00:50:35.610
but I just wanted to drink now.

00:50:46.920 --> 00:50:48.850
You have been so busy since yesterday.

00:50:49.250 --> 00:50:51.720
Although I'm not sure what you're doing.

00:50:52.160 --> 00:50:54.520
Have you seen me?

00:50:54.960 --> 00:50:58.400
Certainly. You are easy to spot.

00:50:58.560 --> 00:50:59.560
Is it easy to notice?

00:51:01.230 --> 00:51:02.500
That's how it was intended.

00:51:02.500 --> 00:51:04.770
Before this, two court ladies did not notice me

00:51:04.770 --> 00:51:06.500
and talked openly.

00:51:06.500 --> 00:51:09.310
I must return to the queen.

00:51:11.940 --> 00:51:13.010
Bowl.

00:51:58.790 --> 00:52:00.260
Since I've been caught,

00:52:00.960 --> 00:52:02.330
then I'll finish for today.

00:52:08.870 --> 00:52:11.000
When she saw me

00:52:11.600 --> 00:52:15.970
I appeared before her like a flower.

00:52:27.180 --> 00:52:28.390
How so.

00:52:35.830 --> 00:52:36.960
You will get hurt.

00:52:47.770 --> 00:52:49.210
Do not touch with bare hands.

00:53:09.560 --> 00:53:12.960
A feeling that makes you want pain -

00:53:13.560 --> 00:53:14.560
love.

00:53:31.520 --> 00:53:33.180
I'll ask around.

00:53:33.650 --> 00:53:36.790
I'm sure it's nothing serious, so don't worry.

00:53:36.790 --> 00:53:39.190
Ovol is not the type to disappear without saying anything.

00:53:39.690 --> 00:53:41.460
I'm sure something happened to her.

00:53:42.130 --> 00:53:43.930
The Queen Mother enters.

00:53:47.330 --> 00:53:48.400
Queen Mother.

00:53:49.630 --> 00:53:51.030
Leave us alone.

00:53:58.680 --> 00:54:01.710
Remember everything I say now.

00:54:02.780 --> 00:54:05.380
In the whole palace you can only trust me,

00:54:05.380 --> 00:54:07.680
because I'm in the same boat with you.

00:54:08.390 --> 00:54:12.590
You must tell me everything, without hiding anything.

00:54:13.690 --> 00:54:16.690
This is the only way the girl and I can survive.

00:54:45.360 --> 00:54:47.090
How good.

00:54:47.790 --> 00:54:51.090
Prince Yeonpyeong, Chief Eunuch and myself.

00:54:52.930 --> 00:54:54.060
Chief Eunuch.

00:54:54.930 --> 00:54:57.730
Since the queen wanted to read the Seven Books,

00:54:57.730 --> 00:54:59.970
I asked you to get me another copy.

00:55:01.070 --> 00:55:02.110
What?

00:55:04.570 --> 00:55:07.280
You didn't ask me for this.

00:55:07.380 --> 00:55:08.410
Chief Eunuch.

00:55:08.980 --> 00:55:11.720
Over the years, have you fallen ill with dementia?

00:55:12.120 --> 00:55:13.980
I clearly remember what I ordered.

00:55:14.380 --> 00:55:17.160
Go to Kyujangak immediately and convey my orders.

00:55:17.750 --> 00:55:19.690
Do you want me to leave immediately?

00:55:19.690 --> 00:55:21.990
Maybe we'll wait until you forget again?

00:55:21.990 --> 00:55:26.030
I’ll just escort you to the Daejojeon Hall and be there in a jiffy.

00:55:27.200 --> 00:55:30.230
I’m not walking alone, Prince Yeonpyeong will protect me if anything happens.

00:55:30.230 --> 00:55:31.800
Why worry so much?

00:55:32.240 --> 00:55:33.500
I advise you to hurry up.

00:55:36.440 --> 00:55:37.710
Yes, well.

00:56:00.300 --> 00:56:02.530
Just like that, did I just get killed by a wild boar?

00:56:03.670 --> 00:56:04.730
Chief Eunuch.

00:56:05.440 --> 00:56:07.640
-Are you hurt?
-I'm fine.

00:56:09.210 --> 00:56:11.240
Looks like his nose was broken.

00:56:11.240 --> 00:56:12.380
No, my nose!

00:56:12.680 --> 00:56:14.280
Well, what is this, blood?

00:56:14.480 --> 00:56:16.350
Yes, my nose is always like that!

00:56:16.680 --> 00:56:20.020
Give it up. Is it a human nose?
can it look like this?

00:56:20.020 --> 00:56:21.650
Hurry up and go to the infirmary.

00:56:21.650 --> 00:56:23.820
Dear God. He said he was fine.

00:56:25.180 --> 00:56:26.820
Ovol, the missing court lady,

00:56:26.820 --> 00:56:28.530
was in the palace with concubine Cho

00:56:28.530 --> 00:56:30.690
on the day the queen fell into the lake.

00:56:31.340 --> 00:56:33.560
They will force her to give false testimony.

00:56:33.700 --> 00:56:36.400
It all happened when the queen found out

00:56:36.400 --> 00:56:37.570
that it was you who attacked her.

00:56:38.800 --> 00:56:41.000
Her target is Concubine Cho, not me.

00:56:42.410 --> 00:56:43.440
Revenge.

00:56:44.010 --> 00:56:45.880
Is this what the queen wants?

00:56:51.010 --> 00:56:52.050
Your Majesty.

00:56:53.050 --> 00:56:54.050
Hwajin.

00:57:01.590 --> 00:57:02.690
I'm sorry.

00:57:03.260 --> 00:57:05.430
Hwajin, you have nothing to apologize for.

00:57:05.960 --> 00:57:07.500
It's all my fault.

00:57:08.500 --> 00:57:09.600
What are you talking about?

00:57:14.160 --> 00:57:16.770
Recently I also tried to get rid of the queen.

00:57:18.070 --> 00:57:19.480
She's taking revenge on me, that's why

00:57:19.480 --> 00:57:21.950
trying to blame you
in the lake incident.

00:57:23.710 --> 00:57:25.450
Always the same tricks.

00:57:25.940 --> 00:57:28.560
They falsify evidence
trapping the innocent.

00:57:31.020 --> 00:57:33.490
I will tell everyone that I tried to kill the queen.

00:57:34.390 --> 00:57:35.430
Your Majesty.

00:57:37.030 --> 00:57:40.260
You and I know more about revenge than most.

00:57:40.460 --> 00:57:42.030
More than return all the pain and suffering.

00:57:42.030 --> 00:57:43.430
That's what revenge is.

00:57:44.100 --> 00:57:45.470
The Queen is thirsty too

00:57:45.940 --> 00:57:47.840
put a sword to Hwajin's throat.

00:57:49.840 --> 00:57:52.210
The only way to pacify her anger is

00:57:53.610 --> 00:57:55.110
fall on your knees in front of her.

00:57:56.580 --> 00:57:57.710
There is no other way.

00:57:59.820 --> 00:58:02.720
She planned it all

00:58:02.720 --> 00:58:04.190
to set me up.

00:58:04.720 --> 00:58:06.460
I will intervene and put an end to this.

00:58:08.540 --> 00:58:11.400
Don't forget about the great thing
which you are aiming for.

00:58:11.460 --> 00:58:14.200
Or have you already forgotten how much
insults had to be endured for the last

00:58:14.200 --> 00:58:16.100
2 years to properly prepare?

00:58:16.330 --> 00:58:17.530
For a great cause

00:58:18.120 --> 00:58:20.300
you should get away with it.

00:58:23.440 --> 00:58:26.380
Never in my life did I want to be a king,

00:58:27.710 --> 00:58:29.210
a puppet in the wrong hands.

00:58:30.950 --> 00:58:34.820
I came to this palace for one reason only.

00:58:37.650 --> 00:58:39.520
No more running away.

00:58:53.500 --> 00:58:55.640
No need to advise me to run again.

00:58:56.010 --> 00:58:57.870
I definitely won't run away.

00:59:00.280 --> 00:59:02.310
I'll search every crevice

00:59:02.310 --> 00:59:04.110
and I will find Ovol.

00:59:05.000 --> 00:59:07.460
Most likely, they are interrogating her somewhere in the palace,

00:59:07.780 --> 00:59:09.380
as soon as they extract a confession,

00:59:09.620 --> 00:59:11.750
you will be punished immediately.

00:59:12.590 --> 00:59:13.920
Please wait,

00:59:15.430 --> 00:59:16.560
until I find her.

00:59:17.390 --> 00:59:18.460
Fine.

00:59:18.700 --> 00:59:21.900
But if something goes wrong, I will intervene immediately.

00:59:22.830 --> 00:59:24.700
And then don't stand in my way.

00:59:25.500 --> 00:59:27.000
This is an order.

00:59:27.670 --> 00:59:29.640
Too many lives have already been lost.

00:59:30.410 --> 00:59:31.570
Today

00:59:32.780 --> 00:59:34.610
I don't want to lose anyone.

00:59:48.660 --> 00:59:52.530
Your Majesty, you must take care of yourself.

00:59:53.760 --> 00:59:55.060
I'll try.

00:59:55.630 --> 00:59:58.060
Kneel or crawl at their feet,

00:59:58.060 --> 01:00:00.340
pretending to be stupid, like it's a misunderstanding, -

01:00:01.000 --> 01:00:02.970
I will do anything to avoid problems.

01:00:04.910 --> 01:00:05.940
Your Majesty.

01:00:24.830 --> 01:00:27.260
You all must put on your uniform.

01:00:27.920 --> 01:00:30.200
We go in search of the court lady.

01:00:30.670 --> 01:00:32.670
It is believed that she is in the palace.

01:00:34.540 --> 01:00:36.710
Make sure no one sees you.

01:00:37.040 --> 01:00:39.280
Be extremely careful.

01:00:55.890 --> 01:00:58.960
Mortal boredom.

01:01:02.060 --> 01:01:03.930
What to do for fun?

01:01:05.640 --> 01:01:06.740
Your Majesty.

01:01:06.740 --> 01:01:08.910
The other day I managed to get

01:01:08.910 --> 01:01:10.810
this silk yarn is from the Qing.

01:01:12.580 --> 01:01:14.180
Do you have a warehouse in your pocket?

01:01:14.180 --> 01:01:17.750
I thought someday you
want to return to your hobby.

01:01:19.250 --> 01:01:21.020
Sorry, of course, but no, thanks.

01:01:21.060 --> 01:01:22.350
It's worth picking up a needle,

01:01:22.350 --> 01:01:24.250
there is no living space left on the fingers.

01:01:24.250 --> 01:01:25.290
Therefore

01:01:26.490 --> 01:01:28.120
I'm fully armed.

01:01:30.530 --> 01:01:32.360
Have you just shown me a fakushka?

01:01:33.460 --> 01:01:35.730
What are you talking about? This is called a thimble.

01:01:36.070 --> 01:01:38.300
Have you decided this is a toy, Your Majesty?

01:01:39.440 --> 01:01:40.540
Lady Choi.

01:01:41.270 --> 01:01:42.740
Are you really off topic?

01:01:47.240 --> 01:01:48.480
Hongyeon, you too?

01:01:52.640 --> 01:01:54.980
Does the thimble have some hidden meaning?

01:01:55.280 --> 01:01:58.420
I prepared it for you
Don't prick your fingers while sewing.

01:01:59.760 --> 01:02:02.020
I am tormented by vague doubts.

01:02:13.200 --> 01:02:16.740
Your Majesty, I was so worried about you.

01:02:16.740 --> 01:02:18.340
You're ahead of me.

01:02:19.280 --> 01:02:22.220
The king shouldn't run away
shining his heels, he lingered.

01:02:25.450 --> 01:02:26.920
Is the queen at home?

01:02:28.280 --> 01:02:30.520
I heard Her Majesty is walking by the lake.

01:02:32.150 --> 01:02:33.590
By the lake? Why suddenly?

01:02:35.160 --> 01:02:36.830
Concubine Cho's words coincided

01:02:37.230 --> 01:02:40.630
with the words of His Majesty.

01:02:41.300 --> 01:02:44.330
She said that evening
I haven't even met the queen.

01:02:45.330 --> 01:02:48.670
That she ran away after hearing a loud sound.

01:02:49.740 --> 01:02:53.140
But whether it’s true or false, I don’t know.

01:02:53.710 --> 01:02:55.040
It just looks like a woman

01:02:55.040 --> 01:02:58.280
which the eunuch and the servants saw,
stole royal gifts,

01:02:58.850 --> 01:03:02.920
was indeed Cho's concubine.

01:03:03.590 --> 01:03:06.960
Or she fell into the queen's trap.

01:03:08.720 --> 01:03:10.830
Before she spread her wings.

01:03:14.700 --> 01:03:15.730
Your Majesty.

01:03:16.120 --> 01:03:18.200
Concubine Cho is now in the Dongmyeongjeong Hall.

01:03:37.450 --> 01:03:40.090
I will protect you, Your Majesty.

01:03:46.330 --> 01:03:48.030
She came of her own free will.

01:03:49.870 --> 01:03:52.970
Apparently, Ovol was closer to her than we expected.

01:03:53.300 --> 01:03:55.910
That's great. It turned out to be easier than we thought.

01:03:56.240 --> 01:03:57.540
Since she came herself,

01:03:57.540 --> 01:03:59.710
you must make her confess everything.

01:04:00.180 --> 01:04:02.650
Health is more important to me

01:04:03.050 --> 01:04:04.780
I'll finish my meal first.

01:04:04.780 --> 01:04:06.420
You are absolutely right.

01:04:57.360 --> 01:04:58.830
Everything is wrong.

01:04:59.800 --> 01:05:03.570
Mrs. Hwajin would never do such a thing.

01:05:05.310 --> 01:05:09.310
Even if you kill me, the truth will not change.

01:05:17.120 --> 01:05:18.250
Poor thing.

01:05:18.720 --> 01:05:21.590
You're like a devoted little dog who licks

01:05:21.590 --> 01:05:24.130
the hands of the mistress about to stab you.

01:05:26.030 --> 01:05:28.060
It's too late to admit.

01:05:30.070 --> 01:05:32.770
Your owner, Hwajin, blamed everything on you.

01:05:36.140 --> 01:05:37.310
This can't be true.

01:05:45.080 --> 01:05:46.150
Here.

01:05:47.380 --> 01:05:48.750
Wow, you're good.

01:05:49.950 --> 01:05:51.020
Like this.

01:05:59.360 --> 01:06:02.000
-God.
-Such valuable yarn.

01:06:02.060 --> 01:06:04.030
The eternal problem with expensive tchotchkes.

01:06:04.030 --> 01:06:05.570
So fragile.

01:06:06.400 --> 01:06:07.470
Let's see.

01:06:08.040 --> 01:06:10.710
Let's find something stronger.

01:06:19.380 --> 01:06:21.720
"Leave your false self"?

01:06:22.220 --> 01:06:24.350
"Leave your false self"?

01:06:24.350 --> 01:06:25.490
What is this?

01:06:25.490 --> 01:06:28.820
You embroidered these hieroglyphs yourself,
when I had a free minute.

01:06:29.090 --> 01:06:31.460
I don't know what they mean, I'm illiterate

01:06:31.460 --> 01:06:33.300
but I think it's a beautiful verse.

01:06:33.660 --> 01:06:35.630
This is the first time I've seen this.

01:06:36.170 --> 01:06:39.640
It so happened that you
The queen was not caught doing this work.

01:06:40.940 --> 01:06:42.670
Is this a love poem?

01:06:42.670 --> 01:06:45.780
This is a suicide note.

01:06:47.610 --> 01:06:49.580
Did I embroider it before falling into the lake?

01:06:49.580 --> 01:06:51.950
Did I understand correctly?

01:06:51.950 --> 01:06:52.980
Yes.

01:06:53.020 --> 01:06:54.220
But I didn't have

01:06:54.280 --> 01:06:56.650
sleep problems and loss of appetite?

01:06:56.820 --> 01:06:59.290
Were. And you sighed constantly.

01:06:59.290 --> 01:07:01.090
She always looked depressed.

01:07:01.200 --> 01:07:03.230
Sometimes you started crying for no reason.

01:07:04.790 --> 01:07:07.800
Your Majesty, do you remember everything?

01:07:08.030 --> 01:07:09.200
No.

01:07:09.870 --> 01:07:13.240
And I didn’t give away things that were dear to me to anyone?

01:07:16.040 --> 01:07:18.410
You gave it to me

01:07:18.410 --> 01:07:19.910
although they used to value it very much.

01:07:20.110 --> 01:07:21.210
And

01:07:21.580 --> 01:07:23.810
gave the ring to Lady Choi.

01:07:27.180 --> 01:07:28.350
Cho Hwajin was wrong.

01:07:28.880 --> 01:07:31.720
Kim Soyeon didn't try to lure her into a trap.

01:07:32.420 --> 01:07:33.690
And I wanted to commit suicide.

01:07:37.060 --> 01:07:38.260
Isn't this Cheoljong?

01:07:38.460 --> 01:07:40.460
The king is coming!

01:07:40.960 --> 01:07:43.000
Wasn't he the one who said that kings shouldn't run?

01:07:43.430 --> 01:07:46.070
Just his face sent my blood pressure skyrocketing.

01:07:48.170 --> 01:07:49.270
What?

01:07:49.940 --> 01:07:51.210
Are you looking for a fight?

01:07:52.840 --> 01:07:54.040
Shall we settle like men?

01:07:54.980 --> 01:07:58.180
Is that all? Is this your choice?

01:07:59.080 --> 01:08:00.380
What's the matter?

01:08:00.380 --> 01:08:02.520
Are you making a fool of yourself again?

01:08:03.690 --> 01:08:06.590
Have I really been deceived by your lying eyes and speeches?

01:08:07.760 --> 01:08:10.830
It was you who deceived me all along.

01:08:11.880 --> 01:08:15.260
I didn’t know that it was you who tried to kill me, I even slept in the same room with you.

01:08:15.260 --> 01:08:17.370
So shouldn't I be angry now?

01:08:17.530 --> 01:08:19.000
You said it yourself

01:08:20.140 --> 01:08:23.570
that only a coward attacks the weaker.

01:08:25.020 --> 01:08:26.310
Are you trying to take revenge on me?

01:08:27.440 --> 01:08:30.050
In that case, I won't sit idly by either.

01:08:31.550 --> 01:08:33.780
and turn a blind eye to all your machinations.

01:08:40.920 --> 01:08:42.490
What is he carrying?

01:09:00.810 --> 01:09:01.880
What?

01:09:15.120 --> 01:09:16.730
What should I do

01:09:17.830 --> 01:09:20.600
with this stupid weakling?

01:09:43.720 --> 01:09:45.050
The Dowager Queen.

01:09:45.400 --> 01:09:47.160
If you are looking for someone to blame for what happened,

01:09:47.160 --> 01:09:48.620
I'm ready to accept the punishment.

01:09:49.560 --> 01:09:53.160
Can you clarify who I'm looking for?

01:09:54.730 --> 01:09:58.170
My lady-in-waiting, Ovol, has disappeared.

01:09:58.770 --> 01:10:00.070
What do I have to do with it?

01:10:01.000 --> 01:10:02.240
Do you think I did this?

01:10:02.380 --> 01:10:04.660
Because you needed something from me.

01:10:07.040 --> 01:10:10.750
And I’m ready to voice what you really wanted to hear.

01:10:12.850 --> 01:10:14.950
Then let's listen.

01:10:17.120 --> 01:10:19.360
When the queen fell into the lake

01:10:19.990 --> 01:10:21.590
I was nearby.

01:10:23.990 --> 01:10:25.490
Someday you too will lose

01:10:26.660 --> 01:10:29.160
person dear to you.

01:10:47.850 --> 01:10:50.290
For a moment my emotions got the better of me,

01:10:52.760 --> 01:10:54.890
and I pushed the queen into the lake.

01:11:04.620 --> 01:11:07.040
Let me take responsibility
for what happened on yourself.

01:11:07.240 --> 01:11:10.140
I ask you, have mercy on those
who did nothing wrong.

01:11:12.070 --> 01:11:15.880
I will gladly accept any punishment
for what she did.

01:11:18.210 --> 01:11:19.280
Seriously?

01:11:26.090 --> 01:11:28.790
You know what this letter is about.

01:11:30.190 --> 01:11:32.900
You received it from the Queen Mother.

01:11:34.730 --> 01:11:37.170
Ovol gave it to us.

01:11:38.100 --> 01:11:41.300
The place, date and time indicated therein,

01:11:41.440 --> 01:11:44.760
coincide with when and where
there was an accident with the queen.

01:11:45.140 --> 01:11:47.580
What do you think this means?

01:11:48.080 --> 01:11:51.610
This is the first time I've seen him.

01:11:53.080 --> 01:11:57.790
Did you really think that you could hide everything?

01:11:59.390 --> 01:12:01.960
And you have a very high opinion of yourself.

01:12:02.960 --> 01:12:05.490
You know you're just a shadow.

01:12:10.170 --> 01:12:11.930
The Dowager Queen.

01:12:12.370 --> 01:12:15.770
I assure you this letter is fake.

01:12:16.040 --> 01:12:17.470
But I am sure of the opposite.

01:12:17.970 --> 01:12:19.880
Since they are from the same Cho family,

01:12:19.880 --> 01:12:22.880
obviously decided to unite for their own goals.

01:12:22.880 --> 01:12:26.680
Queen Mother
I never talked to anyone,

01:12:26.680 --> 01:12:30.220
even if they were from the same family as her.

01:12:31.150 --> 01:12:36.060
Then who forged this letter?

01:12:40.300 --> 01:12:42.830
Apparently you needed someone to support

01:12:43.370 --> 01:12:45.470
your plans.

01:12:50.970 --> 01:12:53.080
The King is here!

01:12:55.640 --> 01:12:56.780
Your Majesty.

01:12:58.610 --> 01:13:00.080
The Dowager Queen.

01:13:00.120 --> 01:13:02.520
You have arrived. Great.

01:13:02.890 --> 01:13:05.020
The royal concubine confessed.

01:13:05.790 --> 01:13:08.360
She said she pushed the queen into the lake with malicious intent.

01:13:10.860 --> 01:13:12.800
It's all a lie.

01:13:12.800 --> 01:13:15.330
Your Majesty, come to your senses.

01:13:17.770 --> 01:13:20.140
I know you're crazy about her

01:13:20.140 --> 01:13:22.970
but I can't let you judge,

01:13:22.970 --> 01:13:24.810
knowing that you are biased.

01:13:25.240 --> 01:13:29.280
Are you trying to protect a criminal?

01:13:29.810 --> 01:13:32.510
She tried to harm the queen, your wife.

01:13:34.180 --> 01:13:35.980
Tell him yourself!

01:13:36.390 --> 01:13:39.090
Who pushed the queen into the lake?

01:13:51.030 --> 01:13:52.230
It was me.

01:13:52.700 --> 01:13:53.770
Hwajin.

01:13:58.110 --> 01:13:59.270
Did you hear?

01:14:03.010 --> 01:14:05.980
If you insist that she's just taking the blame,

01:14:06.280 --> 01:14:09.020
I'll give you the opportunity to prove it.

01:14:11.150 --> 01:14:12.450
Come in!

01:14:39.720 --> 01:14:43.050
She admitted, what are we going to do now?

01:14:43.190 --> 01:14:46.360
She will be needed as a witness, take care of her.

01:14:50.360 --> 01:14:51.490
What are you doing?

01:15:12.450 --> 01:15:13.480
Grab it!

01:15:35.740 --> 01:15:38.570
If you confess right here

01:15:38.570 --> 01:15:40.080
and agree to be beheaded,

01:15:40.840 --> 01:15:43.710
I won't doubt her.

01:15:54.590 --> 01:15:56.090
Cheoljong said that every night

01:15:56.090 --> 01:15:57.690
sees his head being cut off.

01:15:59.030 --> 01:16:00.500
He's clearly feeling bad now.

01:16:01.530 --> 01:16:02.600
This is a failure.

01:16:18.250 --> 01:16:19.850
I will reveal the truth!

01:16:21.250 --> 01:16:24.120
I will accept your will, Your Majesty!

01:16:25.750 --> 01:16:27.920
It's not her who needs to be executed!

01:16:34.930 --> 01:16:36.000
Your Majesty!

01:16:38.530 --> 01:16:39.600
I beg you.

01:16:46.610 --> 01:16:48.680
Will you go against the will of the king?

01:17:23.410 --> 01:17:25.010
Cheoljong, you scoundrel.

01:17:26.250 --> 01:17:27.420
Yes, he's cool.

01:17:31.990 --> 01:17:33.660
What kind of hero does he pretend to be?

01:17:37.890 --> 01:17:38.930
Just a minute.

01:17:39.260 --> 01:17:41.630
The lake will be filled today.

01:17:42.060 --> 01:17:43.300
So I can return.

01:17:44.400 --> 01:17:46.400
Harm the queen...

01:17:47.170 --> 01:17:48.170
Stop!

01:18:09.830 --> 01:18:11.430
Gods!

01:18:13.500 --> 01:18:14.660
What's the matter?

01:18:14.660 --> 01:18:16.870
The water has run out.

01:18:17.500 --> 01:18:18.530
What?

01:18:23.000 --> 01:18:24.910
We took so much water

01:18:24.910 --> 01:18:26.740
that the well has dried up.

01:18:27.910 --> 01:18:29.640
Oh no!

01:18:31.110 --> 01:18:33.550
I'm finished.

01:19:03.750 --> 01:19:05.850
Let me, as a victim of this incident,

01:19:05.880 --> 01:19:07.620
shed light on events.

01:19:13.720 --> 01:19:15.020
I

01:19:20.100 --> 01:19:21.600
tried to commit suicide.

01:19:25.970 --> 01:19:28.170
Do you think there's only one cool guy here?

01:19:28.600 --> 01:19:30.440
I'm the hero here.

01:19:37.250 --> 01:19:39.150
I'm coming back, so it doesn't matter.

01:19:41.050 --> 01:19:46.320
I ask you, do not touch those who are innocent of anything.

01:19:52.290 --> 01:19:53.430
Great.

01:20:32.400 --> 01:20:34.970
Prince Yeonpyeong entered the palace with the thugs.

01:20:34.970 --> 01:20:36.870
They seem to be well trained.

01:20:36.870 --> 01:20:39.470
Problems need to be cut at the root.

01:20:39.470 --> 01:20:41.880
The well has dried up.

01:20:41.880 --> 01:20:43.410
I believed that I should

01:20:43.410 --> 01:20:45.650
leave you to make you happy.

01:20:45.650 --> 01:20:47.320
This daring look!

01:20:47.320 --> 01:20:49.320
How dare he?

01:20:49.320 --> 01:20:51.750
The queen's condition is getting worse every day.

01:20:51.750 --> 01:20:53.390
Maybe it's worth asking

01:20:53.390 --> 01:20:54.760
depose her?

01:20:56.260 --> 01:20:58.290
Now everything will return to its place.
